# Visual brainstorming companion session files
.superpowers/

# Generated data artifacts. data/raw/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the DILIrank
# workbook is 110KB of US-government public-domain data, and committing it pins
# the exact dataset version a result was produced from. DILIrank 2.0 reclassified
# 49 drugs from 1.0, so "which version" is part of the result.
# `data/out/*` and not `data/out/` on purpose: git cannot re-include a file whose
# PARENT DIRECTORY is excluded, so the trailing-slash form would make the two
# negations below silently dead.
data/out/*

# Two deliberate exceptions, on the same reasoning that keeps data/raw/ tracked.
#
# spike-report*.json is the record of Task 1's decision gate - the measurement
# that licensed continuing with the conflict-subset thesis. A gate result that
# only ever existed on one machine is not a gate result.
#
# smiles-cache.json pins PubChem's name -> SMILES resolution, which is an input
# to every QSAR number downstream. PubChem is a live service: it can re-resolve a
# name or change a canonicalisation, and then a "reproduction" would silently be
# a different experiment. 94KB to make the resolution part of the provenance.
!data/out/spike-report*.json
!data/out/smiles-cache.json

